# repeated empty grouping sets emit one row per set
query II
SELECT sum(c), count(*)
FROM (SELECT o.id, c FROM o, LATERAL (SELECT count(*) AS c FROM s WHERE s.k = o.k GROUP BY GROUPING SETS ((), ())) x);
----
13688	4000

query II
SELECT count(*), sum(c)
FROM (SELECT o.id, (SELECT count(*) FROM s WHERE s.k = o.k) AS c FROM o
      UNION ALL SELECT s.id, (SELECT count(*) FROM o WHERE s.k = o.k) AS c FROM s);
----
